# The operator the console lets sign in, as one htpasswd line. Copy this file
# to tally-console-auth.env and paste the line that
# `htpasswd -nBC 12 <operator>` prints after the =, unquoted
# (docs/how-to/cluster/deploy-the-collecting-stack.md). The console takes a
# bcrypt cost of 10 to 17 only.
#
# The console's hostname is public, so generate the password, for example
# with `openssl rand -base64 24`, rather than choosing one. A changed line
# rolls the console on the next `make prod-up`.
htpasswd=
